# The .deb version for BOTH binary packages, and the only place it is written.
#
# packaging/build-deb.sh reads the first non-comment, non-blank line and strips
# whitespace. Comments exist so this note can live with the value it explains.
#
# THIS BRANCH CARRIES A PLACEHOLDER. `integration/bootstrap` is neither release
# line, so there is no real version to name yet and inventing one would leave a
# published-looking string on a branch that publishes nothing. The placeholder is
# still a valid Debian version, so every packaging path below is exercised for
# real rather than skipped.
#
# The release lines overwrite this file with a concrete version:
#
#   release/1.10.1  ->  1.10.1+ceralive.1   (the R0 line, set by todo 15)
#   main            ->  1.10.5+ceralive.1   (the R1 line, set by todo 19)
#
# Versioning is upstream-style, NOT CalVer: the base is the im2d API release the
# tree builds and only the +ceralive counter moves. It is deliberately unrelated
# to the Meson project() version (2.1.0), which is the SONAME's version and stays
# frozen, and to the Radxa Debian version (2.2.0-1) that this package replaces.
0.0.0+ceralive.dev
